    "zh": "从「运行主体」看起：backend 是全部算法与控制逻辑，web3d/frontend 是两条可视化通道，firmware 是真机执行端；「硬件与集成」是结构件与外部仿真的接入口；「验证与研发支撑」产出论文里可复现的数字与测试；「资料与数据」是文档和权重/数据集的落点。",
    "en": "Start with Runtime System: backend holds all algorithms and control logic, web3d/frontend are the two visualisation channels, firmware is the real-hardware actuator end. Hardware & Integration covers the CAD parts and the external-simulation seam. Verification & R&D Support produces the reproducible numbers and tests. Documentation & Data records where docs and weights/datasets live."
